=== Algorithmic Snippets (Linear GADT) ===

All examples verified by OCaml's type system (linearity)
and compiled E2E via Bridge -> Python -> pytket.


Bell state: (H || id) ; CX:
2 qubits, 2 gates
  H q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  perm: [0, 1]

GHZ state (3 qubits):
3 qubits, 3 gates
  H q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  CX q[0, 2]
  perm: [0, 1, 2]

DJ constant (oracle = id):
2 qubits, 2 gates
  H q[0]
  H q[0]
  perm: [0, 1]

DJ balanced (oracle = CX):
2 qubits, 3 gates
  H q[0]
  CX q[0, 1]
  H q[0]
  perm: [0, 1]

HSP (G=Q, X=Q) = DJ:
2 qubits, 2 gates
  CX q[0, 1]
  H q[0]
  perm: [0, 1]

Simon (Z=Q, Y=Q):
2 qubits, 2 gates
  CX q[0, 1]
  H q[0]
  perm: [0, 1]

Swap Bool (twist_plus):
1 qubits, 1 gates
  X q[0]
  perm: [0]

=== End of Snippets ===
